  "text": "This solution, Sindh Resilience Project (SRP) addresses natural catastrophe through public private partnerships in Pakistan between Islamic Republic of Pakistan, Sindh Irrigation Department (SID), Provincial Disaster Management Authority (PDMA), Government of Sindh, International Development Association (IDA), World Bank Group, and Associated Consulting Engineers (ACE) (Pvt) Ltd. The program was implemented in 2016 and focuses on collaboration and regulation.",
